# Build context is the repository root (see Dockerfile). Send only the
# workspace files Studio's build needs; never local installs, builds or
# the design-system checkout scripts/klarlabs-ui.mjs makes.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!messageformat/js/
!studio/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.test.ts
studio/.klarlabs-ui
studio/.klarlabs-ui-src/
studio/e2e/
studio/test-results/
studio/playwright-report/
**/.DS_Store
